  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor side extension’s roof form\r\nin conjunction with the lack of sufficient set back from the front elevation,\r\nby reason of its combined bulk and poor design would create a poorly conceived,\r\nincongruous and contrived form of development that fails to appropriately\r\nrelate or respond to the original dwellinghouse. The proposal would be unduly\r\nharmful to the character and appearance of the original dwellinghouse and the\r\nvisual amenities of the area, &amp;nbsp;contrary to the high quality design\r\naspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D(7)\r\nand D(11) of The&amp;nbsp; London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core\r\nStrategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development.&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
